{"seq":1,"slug":"repair-goods-entry-declaration","title":"进境维修货物申报与担保","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-maintenance-repair-reexport/entry-reexport-writeoff/repair-goods-entry-declaration","wordCount":2284,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"进境维修货物申报与担保\">进境维修货物申报与担保</h1><p>一台待维修设备抵达口岸时，报关单上写什么，直接决定了它此后一年的命运。写错了监管方式，它会以一般贸易的身份被征税；写漏了委托关系，账册的货主字段无处安放；没交担保，后续的区外维修或临时存放都会卡住。进境申报是保税维修这条时间轴的起点，而<strong>担保是起点上最容易被忽视、却在核查时最常被追问的一环</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>进境维修货物的申报要同时回答三组问题。第一组是<strong>身份问题</strong>：这批货是待维修货物还是维修用料件？答案决定了底账科目（科目结构见 <a href=\"../bonded-material-ledger/bonded-repair-material-record\">维修保税料件备案与专用账册</a>），也决定了申报单的品名如何书写——待修复的整机在备案时以&quot;货物品名（待修复）&quot;的料件形态出现，而以整机形态申报进境。第二组是<strong>路径问题</strong>：货物进区还是进场所？综合保税区的规则是&quot;境外进入综合保税区的货物<strong>予以保税</strong>&quot;，除特定情形外；而运往境外的货物<strong>免征出口关税</strong>。第三组是<strong>责任问题</strong>：未发生的税款由谁保证？</p>\n<p>担保正是第三组问题的答案。当事人申请办理特定海关业务时应当提供担保，与保税维修直接相关的三项是&quot;货物、物品暂时进出境的&quot;&quot;货物<strong>进境修理</strong>和出境加工的&quot;&quot;为<strong>保税货物</strong>办理有关海关业务的&quot;（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2010-09/19/content_3758.htm\">《中华人民共和国海关事务担保条例》第五条</a>）。一台待修设备同时命中这三项——它暂时进出境、它是进境修理、它被作为保税货物管理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[境外待维修货物] --&gt; B[进境申报]&#10;  B --&gt; C{申报要素}&#10;  C --&gt; D[监管方式 1371&lt;br/&gt;保税方式 5]&#10;  C --&gt; E[底账科目&lt;br/&gt;待维修]&#10;  C --&gt; F[担保设置]&#10;  F --&gt; G{担保方式}&#10;  G --&gt;|多次同类业务| H[总担保]&#10;  G --&gt;|单次业务| I[逐案担保]&#10;  H --&gt; J[入区保税]&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K[账册挂账&lt;br/&gt;税款暂不发生]&#10;  K --&gt; L[核销周期末端&lt;br/&gt;复出/内销/销毁]\">graph TD\n  A[境外待维修货物] --&gt; B[进境申报]\n  B --&gt; C{申报要素}\n  C --&gt; D[监管方式 1371&lt;br/&gt;保税方式 5]\n  C --&gt; E[底账科目&lt;br/&gt;待维修]\n  C --&gt; F[担保设置]\n  F --&gt; G{担保方式}\n  G --&gt;|多次同类业务| H[总担保]\n  G --&gt;|单次业务| I[逐案担保]\n  H --&gt; J[入区保税]\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K[账册挂账&lt;br/&gt;税款暂不发生]\n  K --&gt; L[核销周期末端&lt;br/&gt;复出/内销/销毁]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>申报要素</th>\n<th>取值/形态</th>\n<th>决定什么</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>监管方式</td>\n<td>保税维修（1371）</td>\n<td>货物进出区的身份</td>\n<td>公告203</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保税方式</td>\n<td>保税维修（5）</td>\n<td>保税状态的归类</td>\n<td>公告203</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品名</td>\n<td>货物品名（待修复）</td>\n<td>账册科目归属</td>\n<td>公告203</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>担保</td>\n<td>逐案或总担保</td>\n<td>未发生税款的保证</td>\n<td>担保条例第五条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周转金额</td>\n<td>依产能与合同自定</td>\n<td>账册容量上限</td>\n<td>公告203</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"申报代码与身份固定\">申报代码与身份固定</h2><h3 id=\"1371-这条代码的含义\">1371 这条代码的含义</h3><p>监管方式&quot;保税维修（1371）&quot;在申报体系里是一个明确的口径：凡以该模式进出的货物，其身份都是维修标的而非贸易标的。规则要求待修复、已修复、无法修复货物<strong>均按 1371 申报</strong>——注意&quot;均&quot;字，它意味着同一批货在进境、修好出境、甚至判定无法修复后出境的全过程中，身份代码保持一致，变化的只是品名（待修复 / 已修复 / 无法修复）。这种&quot;代码不变、品名变&quot;的设计让进出对应关系可以用最简单的键匹配。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么身份必须在进境时固定\">为什么身份必须在进境时固定</h3><p>进境申报是获取保税身份的唯一时点。一旦货物以其他监管方式进境，它就不再是&quot;待维修货物&quot;，后续无论怎样补办都难以回到保税维修的轨道上——这在监管上是一次不可逆的单向操作。因此单证审核的第一关就该是<strong>身份校验</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 进境申报的身份校验与账册挂账&#10;CREATE TABLE repair_entry_declaration (&#10;  decl_id        text PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  decl_no        text NOT NULL,&#10;  customs_mode   text NOT NULL,               -- 1371&#10;  bonded_mode    text NOT NULL,               -- 5&#10;  entrust_id     text NOT NULL REFERENCES repair_entrust(entrust_id),&#10;  item_name      text NOT NULL,               -- 货物品名（待修复）&#10;  serial_nos     text[] NOT NULL,&#10;  declared_value numeric(18,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  currency       text NOT NULL,&#10;  guaranteed_amt numeric(18,2),               -- 担保金额&#10;  guarantee_id   text,&#10;  declared_at    timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  ledger_item_id text NOT NULL REFERENCES repair_ledger_item(item_id),&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_mode CHECK (customs_mode = &#39;1371&#39; AND bonded_mode = &#39;5&#39;)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 身份校验：非 1371 不得进入待维修底账&#10;SELECT d.decl_id, d.decl_no&#10;FROM repair_entry_declaration d&#10;LEFT JOIN repair_ledger_item i ON i.item_id = d.ledger_item_id&#10;WHERE d.customs_mode &lt;&gt; &#39;1371&#39;&#10;   OR i.subject &lt;&gt; &#39;GOODS_WAIT&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 进境申报的身份校验与账册挂账</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> repair_entry_declaration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decl_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decl_no        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  customs_mode   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 1371</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bonded_mode    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entrust_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_entrust(entrust_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  item_name      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 货物品名（待修复）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  serial_nos     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  declared_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  guaranteed_amt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 担保金额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  guarantee_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  declared_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ledger_item_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_ledger_item(item_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (customs_mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '1371'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bonded_mode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 身份校验：非 1371 不得进入待维修底账</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decl_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decl_no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_entry_declaration d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repair_ledger_item i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ledger_item_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">customs_mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '1371'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'GOODS_WAIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最后那条查询应当<strong>永远返回空集</strong>。把它做成一条周期性的对账任务而不是一次性的写入校验，是因为申报数据可能来自外部系统，写入路径不止一条——只有持续核对才能发现绕过校验的旁路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"担保的类型与额度\">担保的类型与额度</h2><h3 id=\"逐案担保与总担保\">逐案担保与总担保</h3><p>担保条例给出了两种形态。单次业务用逐案担保；<strong>一定期限内多次办理同一类海关事务的，可以向海关申请提供总担保</strong>，海关接受总担保后，当事人办理该类海关事务不再单独提供担保（第十一条）。保税维修业务天然是高频重复的——一家维修中心一年可能进境上万批次，逐案担保在操作上不可行，因此<strong>总担保几乎是这一模式的标配</strong>。</p>\n<p>总担保有其代价：它的额度需要提前覆盖一段时期的峰值敞口。总担保的适用范围、担保金额、担保期限、终止情形由海关总署规定，因此额度不是一个纯数学问题，而需要在监管框架内协商确定。工程上要做的，是把<strong>敞口监控</strong>做成实时能力：知道当前有多少货在区内、对应多少暂缓税款、还剩多少担保额度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"担保金额的计算口径\">担保金额的计算口径</h3><p>担保条例第十四条给出了金额标准：为办理特定海关业务提供的担保，担保金额<strong>不得超过可能承担的最高税款总额</strong>，或者海关总署规定的金额。这给出了一个明确的上界——担保不是越多越好，它是一个上限约束而非固定值。</p>\n<p>敞口估算的基本式是&quot;在区货物对应税款之和对担保额度的占用&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mtext>used</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>在区</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>duty</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>vat</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_{\\text{used}} = \\sum_{i \\in \\text{在区}} V_i \\times \\left(r_{\\text{duty}} + r_{\\text{vat}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">used</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">在区</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">duty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 批货物的完税价格，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>duty</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{duty}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">duty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>vat</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{vat}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">vat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别是适用关税税率与进口环节增值税税率。这个式子的实用价值不在精确，而在<strong>监控趋势</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mtext>used</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_{\\text{used}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">used</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 逼近担保额度时，说明要么在修量过大，要么核销周期被拉长，两者都是需要在业务侧干预的信号。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>担保方式</th>\n<th>额度依据</th>\n<th>适用频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单批进境</td>\n<td>逐案担保</td>\n<td>最高税款总额</td>\n<td>低频、大件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续批量进境</td>\n<td>总担保</td>\n<td>海关总署规定的范围</td>\n<td>常态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进境修理</td>\n<td>特定业务担保</td>\n<td>最高税款总额或规定金额</td>\n<td>必有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保税货物业务</td>\n<td>特定业务担保</td>\n<td>最高税款总额或规定金额</td>\n<td>必有</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"保函的必备要素\">保函的必备要素</h3><p>以保函形式提供担保时，条例要求保函<strong>以海关为受益人</strong>，并载明六项内容：担保人、被担保人的基本情况、被担保的法律义务、担保金额、担保期限、担保责任，以及需要说明的其他事项。这六项在系统里应当作为保函登记表的必填列，而不是附件的自由文本——原因很简单：担保期限届满时需要系统主动提醒续保，自由文本无法驱动提醒。</p>\n<h2 id=\"入区保税与出区征税的对称性\">入区保税与出区征税的对称性</h2><p>进境申报的另一半是理解<strong>入区与出区的税务对称性</strong>。综合保税区的规则是：境外进入的货物予以保税；而综合保税区与区外之间进出的货物，区内企业或区外收发货人应当按照货物进出区时的<strong>实际状态</strong>依法缴纳关税和进口环节税；运往境外的货物免征出口关税。</p>\n<p>把这三条并排看，保税维修的税务模型就完整了：<strong>进境不征、出境不征、留在境内才征</strong>。中间那段&quot;区内&quot;是一个税务中性区，货物在其中移动、加工、维修都不产生税负。这一点解释了为什么维修必须发生在区内或特殊监管场所——一旦货物在征税状态下进入区外，就等于默认放弃了复出境的承诺。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;guarantee_record&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;guarantee_id&quot;: &quot;GT-2026-0031&quot;,&#10;    &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;GENERAL&quot;,&#10;    &quot;beneficiary&quot;: &quot;CUSTOMS&quot;,&#10;    &quot;guarantor&quot;: { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;示范银行&quot;, &quot;seal_date&quot;: &quot;2026-03-11&quot; },&#10;    &quot;obligation&quot;: &quot;保税维修进境货物的税款担保&quot;,&#10;    &quot;amount_limit&quot;: 8000000.0,&#10;    &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;CNY&quot;,&#10;    &quot;valid_from&quot;: &quot;2026-04-01&quot;,&#10;    &quot;valid_to&quot;: &quot;2027-03-31&quot;,&#10;    &quot;exposure_monitor&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;used&quot;: 3120000.0,&#10;      &quot;updated_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28T03:20:00Z&quot;,&#10;      &quot;alert_threshold&quot;: 0.8&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"guarantee_record\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"guarantee_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GT-2026-0031\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GENERAL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"beneficiary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CUSTOMS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"guarantor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"示范银行\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"seal_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-03-11\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"obligation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"保税维修进境货物的税款担保\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"amount_limit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8000000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CNY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"valid_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-04-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"valid_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-03-31\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"exposure_monitor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"used\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3120000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"updated_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28T03:20:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"alert_threshold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>alert_threshold</code> 与 <code>exposure_monitor</code> 的组合把担保从一份静态文件变成一条活的监控线。这在实践中能避免一类典型事故：担保到期前敞口仍在高位，续保未及时获批，导致新批次进境被迫停摆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>进境申报是获取保税身份的唯一时点，不可逆；监管方式必须是保税维修（1371）、保税方式 5，待修复整机以&quot;货物品名（待修复）&quot;形态进入待维修底账。</li>\n<li>担保由《海关事务担保条例》第五条覆盖的三类情形共同要求：暂时进出境、进境修理、为保税货物办理业务。</li>\n<li>高频重复的保税维修业务几乎必然采用总担保；担保金额以可能承担的最高税款总额为上限，工程重点是敞口实时监控与到期提醒。</li>\n<li>保税维修的税务模型是对称的三段式：进境不征、出境不征、留在境内才征；区内是税务中性区，这解释了为何维修必须发生在特殊监管区域内。</li>\n<li>身份校验应做成周期性对账任务而非一次性写入校验，以捕获绕过校验的旁路写入。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇 <a href=\"repaired-reexport-writeoff\">维修后复出口与进境账册核销</a> 讲时间轴的另一端：货物修好后如何申报出境，以及账册如何与这条时间轴对平。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"进境维修货物申报与担保","id":"进境维修货物申报与担保"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"申报代码与身份固定","id":"申报代码与身份固定"},{"level":3,"text":"1371 这条代码的含义","id":"1371-这条代码的含义"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么身份必须在进境时固定","id":"为什么身份必须在进境时固定"},{"level":2,"text":"担保的类型与额度","id":"担保的类型与额度"},{"level":3,"text":"逐案担保与总担保","id":"逐案担保与总担保"},{"level":3,"text":"担保金额的计算口径","id":"担保金额的计算口径"},{"level":3,"text":"保函的必备要素","id":"保函的必备要素"},{"level":2,"text":"入区保税与出区征税的对称性","id":"入区保税与出区征税的对称性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"边角料/坏件/替换件处置（复出/征税/销毁）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-maintenance-repair-reexport/bonded-material-ledger/scrap-replaced-part-disposal"},"next":{"title":"维修后复出口与进境账册核销","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bonded-maintenance-repair-reexport/entry-reexport-writeoff/repaired-reexport-writeoff"}}